&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior DevOps Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong&gt; and working knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;. The role requires deep hands‑on experience in &lt;strong&gt;Terraform‑based infrastructure automation&lt;/strong&gt;, cloud security, and container orchestration, with a strong focus on reliability, scalability, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and manage cloud infrastructure primarily on &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt; and partially on &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and manage &lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using Terraform (mandatory)&lt;/strong&gt; for cloud resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain automation using &lt;strong&gt;Ansible and SaltStack&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and support &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; for application and infrastructure deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes environments&lt;/strong&gt; (GKE / EKS), including deployments, scaling, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain &lt;strong&gt;automation scripts&lt;/strong&gt; using Python, Bash, or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and enforce &lt;strong&gt;cloud security best practices&lt;/strong&gt; (IAM, network security, compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with application, security, and platform teams to support production workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex infrastructure and platform issues and support incident resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: 6–10 Years&lt;br&gt;Primary Cloud: GCP (70%)&lt;br&gt;Secondary Cloud: AWS (30%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong hands‑on experience with GCP&lt;/strong&gt; (Compute, IAM, Networking, GKE, Monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working experience with AWS&lt;/strong&gt; (EC2, IAM, VPC, core services).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Terraform – Mandatory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and managing IaC using Terraform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Terraform Certification – Mandatory&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., &lt;em&gt;HashiCorp Certified: Terraform Associate&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;Ansible and SaltStack&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid hands‑on experience with &lt;strong&gt;data dog, splunk etc&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;scripting skills&lt;/strong&gt; (Python, Bash, Shell).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;cloud security concepts&lt;/strong&gt;, IAM, and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting &lt;strong&gt;production environments&lt;/strong&gt; and on‑call operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;multi‑cloud architectures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional &lt;strong&gt;GCP or AWS certifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring and observability tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem‑solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and with cross‑functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and documentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to caste, colour, creed, religion, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, disability, HIV status, or any other status protected by law. Candidates with disabilities who require accommodations during the recruitment process are encouraged to contact our Talent Acquisition team to place a request.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
